WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:43.330 --> 01:46.960
It's especially easy to slack off during summer camp.

01:46.960 --> 01:49.460
As gymnasts on a journey,

01:49.460 --> 01:53.630
I expect everyone to exercise perfect behavior. Understood?

01:54.550 --> 01:57.260
We sure are going deep into the mountains.

01:57.260 --> 02:04.060
I heard that we're staying at a training camp that used to be a run-down school. Also...

02:04.060 --> 02:05.220
Also?

02:05.220 --> 02:06.680
It's haunted...

02:12.060 --> 02:13.860
W-What are you talking about?

02:13.860 --> 02:15.650
It's haunted?!

02:15.650 --> 02:16.360
Is that true?!

02:19.240 --> 02:20.360
It's a rumor, but...

02:22.030 --> 02:25.660
No way! Ghosts, in modern times?

02:33.960 --> 02:40.640
Ghost Story! Summer of the Haunted School

02:41.550 --> 02:44.140
Here I go.

02:44.140 --> 02:46.560
You got the Joker!

02:50.140 --> 02:52.650
Hey, there's another bus coming.

02:52.650 --> 02:53.650
What?!

02:53.650 --> 02:55.730
I wonder if they're going to the same place we are?

02:55.730 --> 02:56.900
No way!

03:08.000 --> 03:11.250
We're finally here!

03:15.250 --> 03:17.460
Oh, it's just the soccer team!

03:17.460 --> 03:19.630
Well, hope we can get along.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.550
Huh?

03:20.550 --> 03:21.930
Chiaki!

03:21.930 --> 03:24.930
Chiaki, you're on the soccer team?

03:24.930 --> 03:26.760
Since yesterday.

03:28.060 --> 03:32.350
You know, I was recruited. They insisted...

03:32.350 --> 03:35.360
Is it just me or does that sound like a transparent lie?

03:35.360 --> 03:36.650
It's just you.

03:37.150 --> 03:38.940
Everyone, gather around!

03:38.940 --> 03:40.610
Yes, sir.

03:45.530 --> 03:47.160
Disgusting...

03:47.160 --> 03:49.660
It looks creepy!

03:53.540 --> 03:56.840
Miyako, are you really scared?

03:57.550 --> 04:03.260
Oh, of course not. Miyako, scared of ghosts? No way!

04:03.260 --> 04:06.800
Miyako scares the ghosts away from the haunted houses!

04:06.800 --> 04:08.260
Hey!

04:08.260 --> 04:09.350
What?

04:09.350 --> 04:12.350
Haunted houses are just for kids!

04:12.350 --> 04:16.230
I'm talking about the possibility of real ghosts appearing!

04:16.230 --> 04:20.150
Meaning that... You really <i>are </i>afraid of ghosts?

04:20.150 --> 04:24.530
E-Even I have a few things I'm scared of...

04:38.750 --> 04:40.590
Welcome, everyone.

04:41.630 --> 04:46.640
This is Munakata-san, the landlord. Everyone, say your greetings.

04:46.640 --> 04:49.050
Nice to meet you!

04:49.050 --> 04:53.140
I expect everyone to follow the rules during your stay.

04:53.140 --> 04:59.940
Whenever I say "NYAAAAA," you must obey everything.

04:59.940 --> 05:01.530
What's "Nyaaaaa?"

05:01.530 --> 05:03.240
"Nyaaaaa?"

05:03.240 --> 05:05.200
If you don't...

05:06.450 --> 05:07.570
If we don't...

05:21.630 --> 05:24.550
Why don't I show you people around?

05:24.550 --> 05:26.340
Come, everyone!

05:28.140 --> 05:33.640
This is the dining hall. Everything is self-service.

05:33.640 --> 05:36.940
No men allowed in the women's room!

05:37.940 --> 05:40.360
Where is the women's locker room?

05:40.360 --> 05:43.070
At the end of this hall.

05:43.860 --> 05:49.410
The lights are broken, so I suggest not using them at night.

05:59.170 --> 06:00.460
NYAAAAA! You mustn't...

06:01.710 --> 06:04.960
You mustn't enter this room!

06:04.960 --> 06:07.470
Is someone in this room?

06:07.470 --> 06:13.010
T-There's no one in this room. Besides, there's no need for you to know...

06:24.360 --> 06:27.740
It really is broken. It's not turning on.

06:27.740 --> 06:29.860
You're not scared, are you Maron?

06:29.860 --> 06:33.870
Maybe... If ghosts really existed.

06:33.870 --> 06:37.710
What do you think, Maron? Do you think they exist, or...

06:42.250 --> 06:43.040
Maybe...

06:44.210 --> 06:45.590
Aaaaa! Behind you!

06:52.340 --> 06:54.050
Just joking!

06:54.050 --> 06:55.930
Maron!!!

06:55.930 --> 06:58.350
Of course they don't exist!

07:03.810 --> 07:06.570
What's the matter?! What's with the screaming?!

07:06.570 --> 07:10.450
T-T-T-There's someone in the next room!

07:10.450 --> 07:15.870
The next room? The one the landlord told us not to go near?

07:15.870 --> 07:20.830
But...the door was slightly open so we took a peek inside...

07:20.830 --> 07:23.670
And eyes were shining in the darkness!

07:27.300 --> 07:29.050
Maybe it was a cat?

07:29.970 --> 07:32.340
The door isn't open.

07:33.430 --> 07:35.850
It was just open...

07:35.850 --> 07:38.430
Nothing should have left the room...

07:38.430 --> 07:39.850
Slowly, okay?

07:39.850 --> 07:40.480
Okay.

07:45.860 --> 07:48.780
There's no one inside... It disappeared...

07:49.740 --> 07:51.950
That means...

07:55.660 --> 07:56.660
What? What?

07:56.660 --> 07:58.040
Are you all right?

07:58.040 --> 07:58.830
What happened?!

07:58.830 --> 08:00.960
A ghost! There was a ghost!

08:00.960 --> 08:04.830
There was something in this room and it just disappeared!

08:06.040 --> 08:08.960
Who could... What was it like?

08:08.960 --> 08:11.970
It was dark and it was just the eyes but...

08:11.970 --> 08:14.760
...they were like those of a small child.

08:14.760 --> 08:17.350
Like those of a large doll.

08:19.430 --> 08:20.850
What's the matter?

08:20.850 --> 08:24.730
Something weird just happened to me, too...

08:24.730 --> 08:25.850
Something weird?

08:25.850 --> 08:28.940
Yeah. I was washing my face at the sink...

08:41.540 --> 08:45.290
I thought there was someone nearby but when I turned around...

08:52.170 --> 08:54.970
...it just disappeared!

08:54.970 --> 08:57.050
No way!!!

09:05.060 --> 09:09.650
What are you doing here?! It's almost time for dinner!

09:09.650 --> 09:13.070
If you need to take a bath, do it quickly!

09:13.740 --> 09:17.070
We're lucky that we get to use an outdoor bath.

09:18.450 --> 09:22.750
It's giving me the creeps because it feels like I'm being watched...

09:22.750 --> 09:24.830
Ah, it feels so good...

09:24.830 --> 09:25.750
What?

09:27.250 --> 09:28.960
Is someone coming?

09:28.960 --> 09:29.420
Huh?

09:33.840 --> 09:34.760
What the...?

09:35.970 --> 09:37.630
It's him...

09:37.630 --> 09:39.140
He came to peep!

09:39.140 --> 09:42.260
What?! Oh no! Who is it?

09:42.260 --> 09:43.640
You'll know soon enough.

09:49.360 --> 09:52.230
What the heck?! That hurt!!!

09:53.070 --> 09:54.230
Chiaki!

09:54.230 --> 09:57.360
Peeping Toms are losers!!!

09:57.360 --> 10:00.240
Peeping? What are you talking about?

10:00.240 --> 10:02.410
I was not peeping!

10:02.410 --> 10:06.460
So then, who else is peeping from over there?!

10:07.750 --> 10:09.080
Get out of here!

10:09.080 --> 10:10.750
Aye aye, sir!

10:12.040 --> 10:13.960
I'm red with embarrassment!!!

10:25.350 --> 10:28.940
Kusakabe-san... Kusakabe-san!

10:30.150 --> 10:32.940
Would you please go to the bathroom with me?

10:33.940 --> 10:37.740
I'm so scared, I can't go by myself!

10:37.740 --> 10:40.070
I'm sleepy...

11:09.310 --> 11:11.980
Notice

11:09.310 --> 11:11.980
Don't go away!

11:09.310 --> 11:11.980
I'll return right after these messages!

11:09.310 --> 11:11.980
Kaitou Jeanne

11:12.860 --> 11:15.480
Notice

11:12.860 --> 11:15.480
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:12.860 --> 11:15.480
Kaitou Jeanne

11:16.440 --> 11:19.740
What the heck?! It's just a curtain!

11:19.740 --> 11:23.370
You're saying there was a little girl running around with this on?

11:23.370 --> 11:26.240
Well, it seemed like that...

11:26.240 --> 11:27.870
It's only an illusion.

11:27.870 --> 11:33.040
The wind probably tore the curtain down and it just floated around the hall.

11:33.040 --> 11:33.830
That's right!

11:33.830 --> 11:34.330
Right?

11:34.330 --> 11:36.920
Ghosts don't exist.

11:38.630 --> 11:43.840
Everyone's making a lot of fuss about ghosts. Humans are weird.

11:43.840 --> 11:47.140
I wonder if it really was just an illusion, though.

11:47.140 --> 11:48.930
Of course it was.

11:48.930 --> 11:54.650
Ghosts don't exist. Whatever you did see was only an illusion.

11:54.650 --> 11:56.730
An illusion...

11:56.730 --> 12:02.280
Maron! It's rude to just sleep and forget about me!

12:02.530 --> 12:05.030
That commotion ruined my sleep!

12:05.030 --> 12:06.950
Nothing but ghost crap.

12:10.040 --> 12:12.960
We really saw it! Right?

12:12.960 --> 12:13.830
Yeah.

12:13.830 --> 12:17.960
A small girl was dragging a white cloak and...

12:17.960 --> 12:21.840
You two saw the same thing so, it wasn't an illusion.

12:21.840 --> 12:24.970
That means... There really is...!

12:24.970 --> 12:27.640
Maybe that landlord knows something?!

12:27.640 --> 12:29.850
Good morning, everyone!

12:29.850 --> 12:31.930
What are you talking about?

12:31.930 --> 12:37.060
Mr. Landlord, is there a ghost in this building?

12:37.060 --> 12:38.360
Ghost?

12:38.360 --> 12:41.860
There were witnesses late last night and at midnight.

12:42.950 --> 12:43.780
So is there?

12:47.740 --> 12:49.240
Mr. Landlord!

12:49.240 --> 12:51.240
There's no such thing.

12:51.240 --> 12:52.160
Huh?

12:52.160 --> 12:54.040
There are no ghosts!

12:54.040 --> 12:55.170
Thank goodness!

12:56.830 --> 12:59.670
Then, what in the world did we see?!

12:59.670 --> 13:02.550
What are you saying that you saw?!

13:02.550 --> 13:05.630
Well, um, it was a small girl...

13:05.630 --> 13:08.640
Don't leave food on your plate!

13:08.640 --> 13:11.770
Now sit down and eat your food.

13:14.940 --> 13:19.060
Smoothly, gracefully and majestically...

13:20.570 --> 13:22.730
Kusakabe, concentrate!

13:30.660 --> 13:32.080
Chiaki!

13:32.080 --> 13:33.580
Oh, dang!

13:35.460 --> 13:42.460
Go to sleep, go to sleep...

13:42.460 --> 13:47.550
<i>Go to sleep...</i>

13:47.550 --> 13:49.640
Excuse me!

13:49.640 --> 13:50.550
Maron.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.940
Satomi!

14:00.310 --> 14:02.570
Mr. Landlord, who was that?

14:02.570 --> 14:04.860
You saw her...

14:06.450 --> 14:09.160
That's my granddaughter...

14:09.870 --> 14:14.080
She used to be a bright and cheerful girl, however...

14:15.410 --> 14:21.420
...she's been like that since this spring.

14:22.170 --> 14:25.960
It was when I was organizing the inside of the old shed...

14:27.550 --> 14:33.640
<i>Grandpa! Are you done yet? Let's play!</i>

14:33.640 --> 14:36.930
<i>I'm busy so maybe later.</i>

14:36.930 --> 14:39.060
<i>Don't come in.</i>

14:40.150 --> 14:42.020
<i>The dust is horrible.</i>

14:43.230 --> 14:45.030
<i>A doll...</i>

14:50.990 --> 14:52.370
<i>Satomi, what's the matter?</i>

14:56.500 --> 14:58.370
<i>Nothing...</i>

14:59.830 --> 15:03.460
She's changed so much since then.

15:03.460 --> 15:07.630
She doesn't talk anymore... She stays in her dark room all day.

15:07.630 --> 15:11.840
At night, she sleepwalks.

15:11.840 --> 15:15.060
So she was the ghost...

15:15.850 --> 15:22.900
I apologize. I tried not to make a big deal about it, but it made things worse.

15:22.900 --> 15:27.030
But I saw Satomi-chan clutching something, as if it were precious.

15:33.740 --> 15:38.870
Don't you think it's abnormal behavior for a small child like her?

15:38.870 --> 15:44.790
There might be something here. Okay, I'll see what I can find.

15:44.790 --> 15:49.760
Test of Courage Competition

15:49.760 --> 15:55.470
On to the campfire now that the whole ghost thing is over!

15:55.470 --> 15:57.260
Or so you'd think...

15:57.260 --> 15:59.770
We're having a "Test of Courage" competition!!!

15:59.770 --> 16:01.850
Well, let's start!

16:03.440 --> 16:10.860
- The course is simply going to the shrine through the woods and bringing back a certain object from the donation box.

16:09.730 --> 16:11.240
- What the heck is the "certain object?"

16:10.860 --> 16:17.950
- The first five groups to finish will go to the Scaring Zones and become the ghosts!

16:17.950 --> 16:21.250
Now, please pick out a ticket indicating your starting time.

16:24.670 --> 16:26.250
Man, I'm lucky!

16:26.250 --> 16:29.550
What a coincidence that I'd be in the same group as you.

16:29.550 --> 16:31.550
What a coincidence...

16:31.550 --> 16:33.050
We're finally alone.

16:38.350 --> 16:39.560
Are you all right?

16:39.560 --> 16:40.770
Thank you.

16:41.560 --> 16:43.440
Pay more attention.

16:43.440 --> 16:44.270
Yeah...

16:46.440 --> 16:49.650
<i>You always make fun of me, but when something happens...</i>

16:49.650 --> 16:52.650
<i>...you're always there to save me.</i>

16:52.650 --> 16:55.570
<i>I don't know what Chiaki is thinking.</i>

17:03.330 --> 17:04.830
These must be the ones!

17:04.830 --> 17:06.170
What are these?

17:08.130 --> 17:09.540
Booooo!

17:14.130 --> 17:15.680
Yay!

17:15.680 --> 17:18.350
How was that? Scared you!

17:18.350 --> 17:19.640
Miyako!

17:19.640 --> 17:22.850
How long do you plan to stay in that position?!

17:26.650 --> 17:29.190
Nagoya-kun, Kusakabe-san Team.

17:29.190 --> 17:31.900
Please go to the Scaring Zone, section F.

17:36.860 --> 17:49.710
Be a good girl... Go to sleep...

18:04.770 --> 18:05.680
Oh, no!

18:08.060 --> 18:12.570
Hey, Maron! Hurry up and get up here!

18:12.570 --> 18:15.070
There's a pretty scenery up here.

18:15.070 --> 18:16.650
Nooooo!

18:16.650 --> 18:19.410
<i>A test of courage at a graveyard...</i>

18:20.160 --> 18:21.410
Maron!

18:22.160 --> 18:23.240
Fin!

18:23.240 --> 18:25.870
She really is possessed by a Demon!

18:27.370 --> 18:29.670
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

18:40.590 --> 18:42.640
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

18:42.640 --> 18:44.510
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

18:44.510 --> 18:45.890
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

18:50.020 --> 18:53.570
Lightning isn't scary.

18:53.570 --> 18:56.610
Don't worry, I'm by your side.

18:56.610 --> 19:02.530
I will protect you, A-chan. So be a good girl.

19:05.040 --> 19:05.910
<i>A doll?!</i>

19:06.450 --> 19:10.170
Grandpa says I can't play with you.

19:10.170 --> 19:13.460
I hate Grandpa for saying that.

19:13.460 --> 19:16.460
Grandpa should just go away!

19:16.460 --> 19:17.090
Hold on!

19:18.840 --> 19:20.050
Who is it...?

19:20.050 --> 19:21.010
Who is it?!

19:22.140 --> 19:25.060
I am Jeanne. I have come to save you.

19:25.060 --> 19:27.140
That's a lie! You came to get in my way!

19:27.140 --> 19:28.930
It's not a lie! Trust me!

19:29.560 --> 19:30.270
Liar!

19:32.150 --> 19:35.570
Satomi-chan! Your doll is a Demon!

19:35.570 --> 19:39.360
That doll is stealing your heart! So, Satomi-chan...

19:39.360 --> 19:40.950
...give me that doll!

19:40.950 --> 19:42.660
I won't let you take it...

19:47.660 --> 19:50.460
Satomi-chan, you love your grandpa, don't you?

19:51.210 --> 19:53.330
I don't need Grandpa!

19:53.330 --> 19:56.670
I don't want Grandpa, you or anyone else!

20:16.310 --> 20:18.230
I have to hurry up and <i>Checkmate!</i>

20:18.230 --> 20:21.400
What are you going to do with my A-chan?!

20:29.870 --> 20:31.040
No!

20:31.040 --> 20:32.160
Not this!

20:36.790 --> 20:39.250
In the name of God...

20:39.250 --> 20:41.420
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:43.260 --> 20:45.090
I seal you here!

20:45.470 --> 20:46.260
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:54.020 --> 20:55.560
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:03.400 --> 21:06.870
MR. LANDLORD!!!

21:06.870 --> 21:10.120
- SATOMI-CHAN!!!

21:07.490 --> 21:10.120
- Goodbye!

21:10.120 --> 21:13.750
Goodbye!!!

21:13.750 --> 21:17.670
SATOMI-CHAN, GOODBYE!!!

21:17.670 --> 21:21.460
Goodbye! See you again!

21:21.460 --> 21:25.720
You know, your ghost was really scary at the Scaring Zone.

21:25.720 --> 21:26.800
Huh?

21:26.800 --> 21:29.350
Miyako, what kind of ghost was that?

21:29.350 --> 21:32.140
What kind? You know what you were.

21:32.140 --> 21:34.640
Your voice really sounded mournful.

21:34.640 --> 21:37.020
I couldn't tell because it was dark...

21:37.020 --> 21:40.690
...but the way you floated with no feet really seemed realistic.

21:40.690 --> 21:43.280
Oh, you've seen a real one?

21:43.280 --> 21:47.160
I wasn't there at the time...

21:47.160 --> 21:49.910
Could it have been...?

21:54.120 --> 21:57.750
THAT WAS A REAL GHOST!!!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:31.550 --> 23:34.970
Oh my, it is Master Toudaiji! What a pleasure!

23:34.970 --> 23:37.680
Ohh, if it is not the city girl, Maron!

23:37.680 --> 23:42.190
Master, how do you intend to deal with the infiltrator, Jeanne?

23:42.190 --> 23:50.320
Do not fear! Jeanne shall not escape the Sheriff of the Northern City, Toudaiji Miyako. Behold!

23:50.320 --> 23:52.660
Ahh, how imposing!

23:52.660 --> 23:56.080
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Infiltration! Mechanical Ninja Castle

23:56.700 --> 23:59.040
Fin, wait for me! I'll save you no matter what!
